warning[RIDL-404]: query `setLevel` is named like a mutation (`set…`) — queries should be read-only or idempotent, so if it mutates state it belongs to `command` (ridl §7.2). If the name is a domain noun rather than a verb (`setPoint`, `resetReason`), ignore this.
